        "The scop sings in the mead hall. Long songs about heroes. Very long. Bring a cushion.",
        "We make mead from honey. That's why there are bees everywhere. Don't flap.",
        "Our pigs live in the woods and eat acorns. The swineherd sleeps out with them. Brave man.",
