        "The monks write books with feathers and ink made from oak galls. One book takes a year.",
        "I made up a riddle: I have a mouth but never eat, a bed but never sleep. Answer: a river.",
        "Most of the days of your week are named after our old gods. Woden's day. Thunor's day.",
