        "The dome opens at sunset like a giant eye. The whole building turns to follow the sky.",
        "Breathing's hard at this height. Walk slowly. Think slowly. Eat a biscuit.",
        "The mirror is so smooth that if it were the size of a country, the biggest bump would be ankle high.",
        "Sometimes the light we see left its star before there were people. It's been travelling all that time.",
        "Breakfast is at sunset. Dinner is at dawn. I've lost track of what day it is. Thursday?",
