      folk: [
        "The volcano's asleep. Mostly. It snores. The ground shivers each time.",
        "Black sand beaches are made of lava that cooled so fast it shattered. Hot on the feet.",
        "Pumice is rock full of bubbles. It floats! Throw it in the sea and watch.",
        "The soil here grows anything. Ash is good for plants. Bad for washing.",
        "Obsidian is volcanic glass. Sharper than a razor. Our ancestors made knives from it.",
        "When the seismograph wiggles, I phone everyone. When it wiggles a lot, I phone louder.",
        "The lava tube was a river of fire once. Now it's a tunnel. Bring a torch.",
        "This whole island came up out of the sea. Fire built it. It's still building.",
      ],
      signs: { home: ['Volcano: snoozing.', 'Hot sand! Shoes!'], town2: ['Hard hats past here.', 'Steam vents. Don\'t sit.'], town3: ['Lava tube tours.', 'Evacuation route ->'] },
