      lost: ['ICE AXE', 'CRAMPON', 'ICE CORE', 'GOGGLES', 'ROPE'],
      folk: [
        "The glacier flows, slower than a snail. It carved this whole valley.",
        "The ice in the cave is blue because old ice squeezes out all the bubbles. Blue as a jewel.",
        "That boulder? An erratic. The ice carried it here from miles away and then just left it.",
        "We drill cores of ice. The bubbles in them are air from long, long ago.",
        "Listen. Creaking, popping. The glacier talks all day. Never stops grumbling.",
        "Rope up, always. Crevasses hide under the snow. One step and you're gone.",
        "The meltwater is milky with rock flour. The glacier grinds stone into powder.",
        "Every year the snout is further up the valley. We put a post where it was. Lots of posts now.",
      ],
      signs: { home: ['Rope up on the ice.', 'Hut: boots off.'], town2: ['Glacier, 1850 ->', 'Glacier, today ->'], town3: ['Crevasses! Stay on path.', 'Ice cave tours.'] },
