      lost: ['LASSO', 'REINDEER BELL', 'FUR BOOT', 'CLOUDBERRY JAR', 'BONE KNIFE'],
      folk: [
        "No trees out here. The ground's frozen solid a little way down. Roots can't get in.",
        "In summer the sun just goes round and round the sky. Never sets. Hard to get the kids to bed.",
        "Reindeer eat lichen. They dig it up from under the snow with their hooves. Clever things.",
        "Cloudberries are orange and taste of sunshine. You find them in the bogs, one per plant.",
        "Arctic foxes go white in winter and brown in summer. Two coats. Very sensible.",
        "We sing songs about people, not things. My song is mostly about my laugh.",
        "The permafrost is thawing. Old things are coming out of the ground. Mammoth tusks, sometimes.",
        "Mosquitoes in summer. Clouds of them. The true kings of the tundra.",
      ],
      signs: { home: ['Reindeer have right of way.', 'Bug spray: yes.'], town2: ['Midnight sun: no curfew.', 'Cloudberries: one each.'], town3: ['Herding camp ->', 'Tree line: south.'] },
