        "Four days and four nights. Nobody sleeps. Nobody wants to.",
        "My costume has eight hundred feathers. I sewed every one. I can't sit down in it.",
        "Steel pans are made from old oil drums, hammered into notes. Rubbish into music.",
        "The samba schools practise all year for one night in the parade. One night!",
        "Confetti everywhere. I'll be finding it in my ears till next year.",
        "The drums start quiet and build and build till the ground's shaking and your heart's keeping time.",
